---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import DraftBanner from "../../components/DraftBanner.astro";
import { CONTACT } from "../../site.config";
---
<Base title="Refunds and cancellation" description="How to cancel a Strong Hire plan, and when we refund.">
  <section class="stage"><div class="wrap page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Legal</p><h1>Refunds and cancellation</h1></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap prose">
    <DraftBanner updated="October 25, 2026" />
    <h2>Cancel anytime</h2>
    <p>Cancel from your account page. Your plan stays active until the end of the period you've paid for, then stops. You won't be charged again.</p>
    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>If an interview fails because of us</strong>, for example the connection drops on our side or no debrief arrives, write to us within 14 days and we'll give the minutes back.</li>
      <li><strong>If you were charged by mistake</strong>, such as a renewal you meant to cancel and haven't used, write to us within 14 days of the charge and we'll refund it.</li>
      <li>Otherwise, payments for a period that has started aren't refunded, except where the law where you live requires it.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>How to ask</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.support}`}>{CONTACT.support}</a> from your account's email address. We reply within two business days.</p>
  </div></section>
</Base>
